# Recipe Finder — environment variables
#
# No secrets are required for TheMealDB (public free tier, no API key).
# The app talks to https://www.themealdb.com/api/json/v1/1/ from the browser.
#
# Copy to apps/web/.env if you later add optional public overrides.
# SvelteKit only exposes variables prefixed with PUBLIC_ to the client.

# Optional future override (not wired by default — base URL is hardcoded in mealdb-client):
# PUBLIC_MEALDB_BASE_URL=https://www.themealdb.com/api/json/v1/1/
